From 0f334f298667dcaf14a8fff36ddc2b6f362cec82 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tumredsun <tumredsun@localhost>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:31:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/35] ARM: dts: sunxi: Add Allwinner A733 device tree

Add the sun60i-a733.dtsi describing the clock controllers (CCU,
CPUPLL and the RTC's clock side), the PIO and R-PIO controllers,
the PCK-600 power controller, the thermal sensors, the SID, UART0
and the SD/MMC host controllers, plus the Orange Pi 4 Pro board.

Also add the missing compatibles in sunxi_sid, rtc-sun6i, sunxi_wdt
and the new pinctrl/CCU bindings files.
---
